  "summary": "Static pattern hits on bundled SDK without corroborating evidence of installer harm",
  "details": "Package ships a bundled dist/index.js implementing a semantic indexer SDK. Static keyword matches fired on POST call sites within the minified bundle and on the substring 'dyndns' at a single location. No specific installer-side data read (env-var scraping, home-directory secret enumeration, credential-file access) is tied to any of the flagged POST calls, and no attacker-controlled destination is named — the matches are keyword co-occurrence in a large bundled SDK. No install-time lifecycle hooks are documented that auto-execute a harmful path on npm install.",
